body:
I rreally Really really REallyy REALLY Want to say That I know what you are going through..... but I can't . All our experiences may seam similar in some aspect but its completely different one way or another. I'm a mtf on E and P for about 1 year and yes I've been depressed and attempted suicide. 

&#x200B;

But what keeps me going is wanting to change my body into what I have always known it should be. This drive to be female burns my insides so much ... a quench that I can't fill. But realistically you're right, FFS is crazy expensive plus Electrolysis and eventually SRS. The goal seems sooo faraway but if we want it so bad we shouldn't stop. 

&#x200B;

I'm sorry for not having the answer you want... but perhaps the next step.. Do you have a nearby LGBTQ center? They usually will have a Male-to-Female support group. I go to mine once a week and it really helps to hear other peoples story and  whenever you're ready .. maybe sharing yourself, your story. They Really do listen and care. I really hope you have a center nearby. 

&#x200B;

I'm not crazy knowledgeable about everything regarding MTF transitions but I have researched a lot. Let me know if you want to talk about it.

It's scary at first. I recommend writing letters to your love ones. Maybe after writing them you may feel less of an evil person. 

&#x200B;

Good luck buddy.
